              "english": "I now have ten books."
            },
            "id": "build-sub-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      "reading": {
        "title": "A short connected story",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "hanzi": "学校里有三百个学生。我们班有二十个人。今天来了十八个学生。",
            "pinyin": "Xuéxiào lǐ yǒu sān bǎi ge xuéshēng. Wǒmen bān yǒu èr shí ge rén. Jīntiān lái le shíbā ge xuéshēng.",
            "english": "There are three hundred students in the school. Our class has twenty people. Eighteen students came today."
          }
        ],
